## 🗺️ SURGICAL SPRINT ROADMAP

### **SPRINT 0.5: CO-PILOT REFOCUS (CRITICAL - Week 1)**
**Theme:** Transform Co-Pilot Pages from Feature Dumps to Outcome-Focused  
**Time:** 20 hours (2.5 days)  
**Priority:** 🔴 **HIGHEST** - Blocks user understanding

**Problem:** Co-pilot pages dump too much technical detail, burying outcomes. Users can't understand value.

**Current State:**
- **Battle Plan Tab** (`InteractiveContentAnalysis`): EXISTS but HIDDEN by default (`initialTab="strategic-doctrine"`)
  - Contains: Technology Foundation, Core Capabilities, Problem Solution Matrix, Value Proposition, In-Silico Workflow
  - Very feature-heavy, technical detail dump
- **Strategic Doctrine Tab** (`DesciStyleDoctrineInsights`): DEFAULT tab, also feature-heavy
  - Contains: In-Silico Overview, Observed Outcomes (buried), Core Capabilities, Advanced Features, etc.
- **War Stories Tab**: Optional, only for co-pilots with journeys

**Solution:** Remove tabbed interface entirely. Refactor to product page pattern (hero → problem → solution → outcomes → technical details collapsed)

**Reference:** See `co-pilot-outcome-refocus-plan.mdc` for detailed implementation guide

**Tasks:**
- [ ] **Remove Battle Plan tab** - Delete `InteractiveContentAnalysis` usage (or repurpose for technical details section)
- [ ] **Remove Strategic Doctrine tab** - Replace `DesciStyleDoctrineInsights` with outcome-focused structure
- [ ] Create `OutcomeFocusedCoPilotPage.tsx` template (no tabs, single page flow)
- [ ] Create `ContentTransformers.ts` helper functions
- [ ] Create `SimplifiedOutcomesSection.tsx`
- [ ] Create `CollapsibleTechnicalDetails.tsx` (reuse Battle Plan content here if valuable)
- [ ] Create `CoPilotDemoSection.tsx`
- [ ] Test with 1 co-pilot (`toxicity-risk`)
- [ ] Migrate all 11 co-pilot pages
- [ ] Update `/app/platform/[coPilotSlug]/page.tsx` to use new template (remove TabbedContent)

**Deliverables:**
- Co-pilot pages transformed to outcome-focused (no tabs)
- Battle Plan tab removed (or repurposed as collapsed technical section)
- Strategic Doctrine tab removed (replaced with outcome-focused flow)
- Technical details collapsed by default
- Problem → Solution → Outcomes narrative flow
- Users understand value in 30 seconds (not 5 minutes)

**Success Criteria:**
- ✅ No tabbed interface (single page flow)
- ✅ Hero headline is outcome-focused (not feature-focused)
- ✅ Problem section has max 3 simple cards
- ✅ Solution section has max 3 simple cards
- ✅ Outcomes section shows key metrics prominently
- ✅ Technical details collapsed by default (Battle Plan content repurposed here)
- ✅ Page loads in <2 seconds

